WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.190 --> 00:00:01.610
- All right y'all I'm still here

00:00:01.610 --> 00:00:03.240
keeping up with my social distancing

00:00:03.240 --> 00:00:05.590
with my family here in Montana.

00:00:05.590 --> 00:00:07.110
This hour though we're
gonna be celebrating

00:00:07.110 --> 00:00:08.450
my new single I Dare You

00:00:08.450 --> 00:00:11.200
that I actually got to record
in six different languages

00:00:11.200 --> 00:00:14.037
which was really a dream come true for me.

00:00:14.037 --> 00:00:16.865
The song is about love in all its forms

00:00:16.865 --> 00:00:19.260
in the face of adversity,

00:00:19.260 --> 00:00:21.630
choosing to love instead of fear.

00:00:21.630 --> 00:00:23.470
I'm proud that there's singers
from all over the world

00:00:23.470 --> 00:00:24.939
sang with me on this track.

00:00:24.939 --> 00:00:26.950
I love all the different languages,

00:00:26.950 --> 00:00:30.100
I actually listen to those
more than the English version.

00:00:30.100 --> 00:00:32.610
But we're singing in
their native languages,

00:00:32.610 --> 00:00:34.230
and we're still excited that

00:00:34.230 --> 00:00:36.350
we actually have them on Zoom today.

00:00:36.350 --> 00:00:38.230
We have Blass from Espana,

00:00:38.230 --> 00:00:41.570
we have Nifuzia from Morocco,

00:00:41.570 --> 00:00:44.250
we have Carolyn from Germany,

00:00:44.250 --> 00:00:46.100
and we also have Mya from Israel,

00:00:46.100 --> 00:00:46.953
how y'all doing?

